### Variables: inject a permanent Supabase JWT locally; never commit tokens.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = {{$dotenv CLOUDBREAK_JWT}}

### Permanent account: get-or-create (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/provision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Repeat: same profile and same supabase_user_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/provision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Current account and survey state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Optional survey (closed body)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acquisition_source": "app_store",
  "practice": "hiker",
  "newsletter_opt_in": false,
  "skipped": false
}

### Or skip it (terminal and idempotent)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"skipped": true}

### Anonymous JWT: expected 403 ACCOUNT_REQUIRED
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/provision
# Authorization: Bearer <anonymous-jwt>

### Delete account (RGPD: local users/data first, then auth.users)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
